   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "So the design keeps SMTP - the\nprotocol is fine - and replaces\nthe storage model entirely:\nseparate content from\nper-recipient state, partition by\nuser, and put each of the four\ndata shapes in a store built\nfor it.",
