   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "sending provider  ->  our SMTP LB  ->  SMTP inbound server\n  1. connection checks: IP on a blocklist? rate-limited? reverse DNS sane?\n  2. envelope checks: does the recipient exist? SPF pass? size acceptable?\n       -> reject NOW with 5xx if it fails: the cheapest possible rejection\n  3. accept the DATA and write it DURABLY to the inbound queue",
   "originalText": "sending provider  ->  our SMTP LB  ->  SMTP inbound server\n  1. connection checks: IP on a blocklist? rate-limited? reverse DNS sane?\n  2. envelope checks: does the recipient exist? SPF pass? size acceptable?\n       -> reject NOW with 5xx if it fails: the cheapest possible rejection\n  3. accept the DATA and write it DURABLY to the inbound queue",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rcv1",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
