   "text": "everything below is asynchronous and retryable:\n  5. virus scan; spam score (content, reputation, DKIM/DMARC verification)\n  6. store the body content-addressed; store attachments by hash\n  7. apply the user's filters and rules  ->  decide the destination folder\n  8. INSERT the per-recipient metadata row (Inbox, or Junk if spam)\n  9. enqueue a search-index write\n 10. push a notification via the real-time server if the user is connected",
   "originalText": "everything below is asynchronous and retryable:\n  5. virus scan; spam score (content, reputation, DKIM/DMARC verification)\n  6. store the body content-addressed; store attachments by hash\n  7. apply the user's filters and rules  ->  decide the destination folder\n  8. INSERT the per-recipient metadata row (Inbox, or Junk if spam)\n  9. enqueue a search-index write\n 10. push a notification via the real-time server if the user is connected",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rcv2",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 940,
   "y": 436,
   "width": 591,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700196,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Under SMTP, replying 250 OK is a TRANSFER OF RESPONSIBILITY: the sending server\ndeletes its copy and considers the message delivered. Acknowledge and then lose\nit, and the email is gone with nobody holding a copy and nobody knowing - the\nexact 'data loss is unacceptable' failure.",
   "originalText": "Under SMTP, replying 250 OK is a TRANSFER OF RESPONSIBILITY: the sending server\ndeletes its copy and considers the message delivered. Acknowledge and then lose\nit, and the email is gone with nobody holding a copy and nobody knowing - the\nexact 'data loss is unacceptable' failure.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 940,
   "y": 518,
   "width": 584,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100029,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700203,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "So the ordering is strict. NOT 'acknowledge, then queue' - a crash there loses\nmail silently. And NOT 'process fully, then acknowledge' - spam and virus\nscanning would hold the SMTP connection open for seconds, and a slow scanner\nwould make the sender time out and retry, duplicating the work.",
   "originalText": "So the ordering is strict. NOT 'acknowledge, then queue' - a crash there loses\nmail silently. And NOT 'process fully, then acknowledge' - spam and virus\nscanning would hold the SMTP connection open for seconds, and a slow scanner\nwould make the sender time out and retry, duplicating the work.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 940,
   "y": 636,
   "width": 562,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100030,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700210,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Note also that rejection happens AS EARLY AS POSSIBLE - at connection and\nenvelope time, before accepting the message body. Rejecting a spam message\nafter transferring 50 KB wastes bandwidth on every one of them, and at spam\nvolumes that is most of your inbound traffic.",
   "originalText": "Note also that rejection happens AS EARLY AS POSSIBLE - at connection and\nenvelope time, before accepting the message body. Rejecting a spam message\nafter transferring 50 KB wastes bandwidth on every one of them, and at spam\nvolumes that is most of your inbound traffic.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 940,
   "y": 718,
   "width": 591,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700217,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And duplicate delivery is a ROUTINE EVENT, not an edge case: SMTP retries after\nany ambiguous failure, so the same message arriving twice is expected.\nDeduplication on (Message-Id, recipient) within a window is essential rather\nthan optional.",
   "originalText": "And duplicate delivery is a ROUTINE EVENT, not an edge case: SMTP retries after\nany ambiguous failure, so the same message arriving twice is expected.\nDeduplication on (Message-Id, recipient) within a window is essential rather\nthan optional.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 820,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
